For \(n>4r+1\), define the lag-\((2r+1)\) exactly unbiased statistic
\[
 \widehat\Omega_n^{12,\mathrm u}
 :=\sum_{k=-2r}^{2r}\frac{1}{N_{n,k}}
       \sum_{i\in J_{n,k}}Z_{n,i}^{(1)}Z_{n,i+k}^{(2)}
 -(4r+1)\frac{1}{N_{n,2r+1}}
       \sum_{i\in J_{n,2r+1}}Z_{n,i}^{(1)}Z_{n,i+2r+1}^{(2)}
\]
and the deterministic deviation radius
\[
 q_n^{\mathrm u}(\delta)
 :=\sqrt{12n}\,(2r+1)(4r+1)K^2
 \left\{\frac{1}{n-4r}+\frac{1}{n-4r-1}\right\}
 \sqrt{\log(2/\delta)}.
\]
